  (s256-ln "// FUNCTOR 1: Multiplicative Complexity {XOR=free, AND=cost 1} Discovery on 5-input Fused SHA-256 Bit-Slices!"
  (s256-ln "// Searches circuits over {XOR, AND, NOT-const} minimizing exact AND-gate count for:"
